WEBVTT

00:10:28.693 --> 00:10:35.040
(Applause)

00:10:35.819 --> 00:10:39.483
And then, with the help of a couple
of friends back in Minneapolis,

00:10:39.507 --> 00:10:41.164
one of them Becky,

00:10:41.188 --> 00:10:43.759
we made an enormous disco ball of it --

00:10:43.783 --> 00:10:45.247
(Laughter)

00:10:45.271 --> 00:10:48.278
that could descend
from the ceiling at my big shows.

00:10:49.057 --> 00:10:53.005
And I felt like I'd had the opportunity
to better understand love,

00:10:53.029 --> 00:10:57.216
even the compulsive parts.

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.936
It isn't a neat, symmetrical
Valentine's heart.